Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,. . . . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, alright
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mode Nash, no survival\Nday. Get away from Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,go, go I don't wanna fail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go 1, 2, 3. Come\Nand find a way. Life for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is looks like\Nyou're finally awake. Was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,everything we've seen\Nbefore a dream yeah to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:02:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,distract us from being\Ndissolved in this room
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,break the door quickly use\Nyour power star platinum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to leave this room right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that you said just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Star Platinum?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, how would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I can tell, it only became\Nreality after I told you about John Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, there's no way\Nyou could have seen my power yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you feel it's existence\Nsince you're my child,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way you should\Nknow the name Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be inconsistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally snapped out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to push myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My thread
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,dissolves so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, were you dreaming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've been in a nightmare. Then I woke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,up to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we were both\Nbeing shown specific visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,watching a movie. Sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we had some\Npopcorn, it'd be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't Move anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you move?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The current situation could be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Within another dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't move at\Nall, then it's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A harsh reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One which we might not escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:03:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out the stand that\Nyou just used to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you bring it out in a clump?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, your strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It took everything I had just to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no help of opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Like that. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you bring it out further?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it a little closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be for the best if you could\Nshift it over a little further to my left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not what I'd call\Nideal, but it's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This should at least\Nhelp us get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, pull me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This pain I feel and this irritation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, how dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This irritation I'm feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this\Ncould be a hallucination!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Lift your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, we were\Nsaved because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a human bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Further, it's a part of the pelvis\Ncalled the sacrum from an adult female.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the surface condition,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems to have been\Ndissolved by some kind of acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been dissolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the same stuff? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no clue why you'd carry\Nsomething like that around,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the only one who saw\Nhim, but the kid exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery, but this is\Nproof that he's actually here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Code 909, security level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Abnormality detected\Noutside the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Security level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Code 909.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because once we left that room,\Nyou became a wanted criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said from the start,\NI'm getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have it, right? The pendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's more important\Nthan it looks, so don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, breakout time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed\Nit escaped my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not many guards. What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a semi-public area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goal is a window at the western wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The window faces out to the shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and from there we'll escape to\Nthe outside world via submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a little connection with the\Norganization called the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They've arranged it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing any\Ncameras in this hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The window is just down this\Njunction here, to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,From the window to the shore\Nis just under 20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have a lot\Non your mind right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have to focus on getting outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was that van.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Chulene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking? Don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. Just clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can stand up on my own without any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be more careful when you trip next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if\Nthis flies away or you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? I told you this was\Nimportant, so hold on to it here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really going to Tokyo\Ndespite everything our daughter is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,having to go through right now What\Nkind of father are you Hello Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always thinking everything\Nthrough calmly and logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I was a kid\Ndying of a high fever,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't be bothered to come see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or when I was doing a little joyriding\Nand they accused me of stealing the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on an airplane heading\Nsomewhere exotic instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet somehow, I still\Ngrew up safe and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a troublemaker that doesn't get\Nhurt no matter how many times I fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So lucky! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's important, hold onto it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:09:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit late for…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not noticed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something has been following us, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody down this hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they must have gone the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a guard. What's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something forced its way\Npast this metal gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoner has to have\Ngone this way. Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to take care of us himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep heading to the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll face off against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's John Gallier's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought his attacks\Nhad only been a dream. Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this still a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not! This is happening! Time stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there were two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It conjured visions for Jolene and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It even went so far as to put John Gallier's\Nactual stand Inside of those dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything had been a\Nset up To lead to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up precisely for this moment Where I'd\Nhave no other options But to stop time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep my daughter safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Their target
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Was always me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is about to start? Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you were one\Nstep too late, Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they were already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the invincible Joestar couldn't stop\Nme from obtaining that which I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You were no match for\Nthe power of Palesnake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The shooter's still up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought his stand was just a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's move while\Nhe's still reloading!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Let's go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There can only be one stand per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, there were two\Nenemies from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gallier's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mushy Guy, the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:14:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this pendant and get out\Nof here while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A transmitter has been\Nfitted inside of the pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So they can determine your location?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The submarine has been programmed to find\Nand follow this signal automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It homes in like a beacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what I'm saying, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go to the shore and the submarine\Nwill come to you, easy as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,From there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the speed wagon foundation that I mentioned\NWill come and take you somewhere safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always incredibly\Nimportant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell? Your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I'm only bleeding a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up to you in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All because you protected me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The other enemy took\Nsomething away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why you\Ncouldn't dodge the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he take?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be your stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chulene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This thread is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading to the shore\Nto make our great escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't interfere. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When did she acquire this kind of stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:16:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A stand as powerful as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have already been investigated\Nbefore she entered the facility all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drop the gun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Simon didn't say drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just checking out\Nthe angles I wanted to make
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,sure to line up the easiest\None to hit you from See,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer if your jaw were facing\Na little further to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I knew she was this powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have taken care of her\Nfirst before going after Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my mistake to\Nmake him my first target!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Pale Snake already aware\Nof this turn of events?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt that\Nshe's Jotaro's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A part of the Joestar Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene. Earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were still stuck in that dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you said you would stay\Nhere in this prison for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the sake of a child that\Nyou don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed me as if he\Ndepended on me. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back in. I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What I saw was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We nearly made it to the shore! Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gently force authorized!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A guard has been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal is armed and dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If it comes to a shoot to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you've got some kind\Nof connection with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But if a submarine is\Nreally going to come for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.98,0:17:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then they must have considerable financial\Nassets and technological capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This wound, hit by a ricochet\Nbullet, they'd have to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they'd be able to treat it\Nbetter than any regular doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything you told me was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The submarine was already\Nhere and waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he got shot, the wound is shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,None of his vitals were hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not supposed to be a fatal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did your\Nheart stop beating dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the blood of a Joestar. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a good head on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make it on your own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see some movement on the\Nother side of the fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not on the\Nother side of the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about me, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She has her hands up. Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not fire! She's unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But there should be another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The tall man with a cap\Nwho came to visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:20:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tragedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But your father is\Nalready as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His powers were taken\Nby that weird mushy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He barely survived the trap\Nhe set for your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the The one who\Ndid it went back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not outside, but inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit's goal relies\Non their ability to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,steal people's stands by\Nmaking them materialize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That mushy bastard deliberately\Nwent back inside of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't try to make a run for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so they must have what they\Nneed inside the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly think\Nyou can get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think your dad\Nwill come back to life if you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be the one to tell\Nyou, but a dead body just rots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That bone I gave you was from my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He took her soul as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother gave birth to me\Nwhile she was a prisoner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've been hiding in\Nthis prison ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was able to survive\Nbecause of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I have this\Nunexplainable confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe my\Nfather is actually dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he'll be okay if\NI can get his stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have the mighty stand\Nwith the ability to stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and we couldn't have done\Nit without you, Johngalli.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I make quite a formidable duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, could you help me\Nback to the men's prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.54,0:23:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the only one that\Nknew my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And it just so happens you were\Nthe one who murdered that guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With this everything\Nwill work out very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.58,0:23:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To be able to communicate\Nan idea to someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotar himself had said what\Na wonderful thing it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the proof right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
